<title>HUNGARY: Hungary Apr ind.output up 9 pct m/m, 11.4pct yr/yr.</title>
<headline>Hungary Apr ind.output up 9 pct m/m, 11.4pct yr/yr.</headline>
<dateline>BUDAPEST 1997-04-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Hungary's Central Statistical Office (KSH) on Tuesday revised its preliminary April industry output figures to nine percent month-on-month and 11.4 percent year-on-year, from 9.8 percent and 12.3 percent respectively.</p>
</text>
